+## 2024-09-24 - Memoize O(N) loops in render calls
+
+**Learning:** TargetBoardMatrix rendered frequently and inside its render loop, the week header rendering called `getVisitsCountForWeek`, looping over `N` recruits. `N * W` iteration on every interaction triggered major sluggishness.
+
+**Action:** When working with large tables, always ensure row or column aggregation functions invoked during the render cycle are memoized (e.g. `useMemo` map keyed by column) instead of calculating `O(N)` dynamically per item.
